      <span class="eyebrow">Fleet wrap programmes</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="fleet-title">Fleet wrap and brand consistency</h2>
      <p>Fleet wrap is a programme, not a one-off project. The goal is a consistent brand appearance across every vehicle, regardless of make, model or year. We start with a master design that defines logo placement, lettering hierarchy and colour relationships. Each new vehicle that enters the fleet is wrapped to the same specification, even years later.</p>
      <p>Programme deliverables include: master design file in vector format, brand-consistent colour calibration on every wrap, scheduled production and installation to minimise vehicle downtime, removal and re-application at lease end. For fleets of ten or more vehicles we offer an annual maintenance visit to repair stone chips or small damage.</p>
      <p>Typical fleet sectors in Rotterdam: heating and cooling contractors, electrical contractors, cleaning services, food delivery, taxi and limousine, courier and last-mile logistics, port-related services, fitness and personal-training franchises.</p>
